# fish — success
#
# The fish verb carried through: forced past the dice, the outcome reports SUCCESS.
#
# Reached in 1/12 of the sampled location ids.
# fish is tool-gated: RequiredToolRule accepts only Action.CombinedItem, so the fishing_rod
# must be combined with the action, not merely carried.

#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --grant-item fishing_rod --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Field" --period dawn --observe-only "Test Ford"

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

strategy succeed
goal fish
advance 12 180
regions

click keyword 0
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180

click action 0
choose 1
regions
choose 0
advance 12 180

regions
click action 1
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180

expect SUCCESS

# What makes this a fish test rather than an any-verb test.
expect-verb fish
quit
